@startuml 個人送養發佈
title 使用案例1: 個人送養發佈流程

actor "一般會員" as User
participant "auth.py\n(Blueprint)" as Auth
participant "animals.py\n(Blueprint)" as Animals
participant "uploads.py\n(Blueprint)" as Uploads
participant "medical_records.py\n(Blueprint)" as MedicalRecords
participant "animal.py\n(Models)" as AnimalModel
participant "medical_record.py\n(Models)" as MedicalRecordModel
participant "others.py\n(Models)" as AttachmentModel
participant "minio_helper.py\n(Utils)" as MinIO
database "MySQL" as DB

== 驗證會員身份 ==
User -> Auth: POST /api/auth/login
Auth -> DB: 驗證用戶憑證
DB --> Auth: 返回用戶資訊
Auth --> User: 返回 JWT Token

== 填寫動物資訊並建立草稿 ==
User -> Animals: POST /api/animals\n(包含基本資料、健康狀況、行為特徵)
note right: Authorization: Bearer {token}\n狀態預設為 DRAFT

Animals -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證 JWT
Auth --> Animals: current_user_id

Animals -> DB: 查詢 User (current_user_id)
DB --> Animals: User 物件

alt 一般會員
    Animals -> AnimalModel: 建立 Animal\n(owner_id = current_user_id,\n shelter_id = NULL,\n status = DRAFT)
else 收容所會員
    Animals -> AnimalModel: 建立 Animal\n(owner_id = NULL,\n shelter_id = primary_shelter_id,\n status = DRAFT)
end

Animals -> DB: db.session.add(animal)\ndb.session.commit()
DB --> Animals: animal_id

Animals --> User: 返回動物資料 (201 Created)\n包含 animal_id

== 上傳動物圖片 (至少1張) ==
loop 每張圖片
    User -> Uploads: POST /api/uploads/direct\n(multipart/form-data)
    note right: file: 圖片檔案 (JPG/PNG/GIF)\n最大 5MB
    
    Uploads -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證
    Auth --> Uploads: current_user_id
    
    Uploads -> MinIO: put_object()\n上傳圖片到 MinIO
    MinIO --> Uploads: storage_key, public_url
    
    Uploads --> User: 返回 storage_key 和 url
    
    User -> Animals: POST /api/animals/{animal_id}/images\n(storage_key, url, mime_type)
    
    Animals -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證
    Auth --> Animals: current_user_id
    
    Animals -> DB: 查詢 Animal
    DB --> Animals: Animal 物件
    
    Animals -> Animals: 檢查權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
    
    Animals -> AnimalModel: 建立 AnimalImage\n(animal_id, storage_key, url, order)
    Animals -> DB: db.session.add(image)\ndb.session.commit()
    DB --> Animals: image_id
    
    Animals --> User: 返回圖片資訊 (201)
end

== 上傳醫療紀錄 ==
loop 每筆醫療紀錄
    User -> Uploads: POST /api/uploads/direct\n(醫療紀錄附件)
    Uploads -> MinIO: put_object()
    MinIO --> Uploads: storage_key, url
    Uploads --> User: 返回 storage_key 和 url
    
    User -> MedicalRecords: POST /api/medical-records/animals/{animal_id}/medical-records\n(record_type, date, provider, details, attachments)
    
    MedicalRecords -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證
    Auth --> MedicalRecords: current_user_id
    
    MedicalRecords -> DB: 查詢 Animal
    DB --> MedicalRecords: Animal 物件
    
    MedicalRecords -> MedicalRecords: 檢查權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
    
    MedicalRecords -> MedicalRecordModel: 建立 MedicalRecord\n(animal_id, record_type, date,\n provider, details, attachments,\n verified=False, created_by)
    
    MedicalRecords -> DB: db.session.add(medical_record)\ndb.session.flush()
    DB --> MedicalRecords: medical_record_id
    
    loop 每個附件
        MedicalRecords -> AttachmentModel: 建立 Attachment\n(owner_type='medical_record',\n owner_id=medical_record_id,\n storage_key, filename, url)
        MedicalRecords -> DB: db.session.add(attachment)
    end
    
    MedicalRecords -> DB: db.session.commit()
    DB --> MedicalRecords: 確認
    
    MedicalRecords --> User: 返回醫療紀錄 (201)
end

== 提交審核 ==
User -> Animals: POST /api/animals/{animal_id}/submit
note right: 將狀態從 DRAFT 改為 SUBMITTED

Animals -> Auth: @jwt_required() 驗證
Auth --> Animals: current_user_id

Animals -> DB: 查詢 Animal
DB --> Animals: Animal 物件

Animals -> Animals: 檢查權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id)

Animals -> Animals: 檢查狀態\n(status == DRAFT)

Animals -> AnimalModel: 更新 status = SUBMITTED
Animals -> DB: db.session.commit()
DB --> Animals: 確認

Animals --> User: 提交成功訊息 (200)\n「審核中」狀態

note over User, DB
    <b>後置條件:</b>
    - 動物資料已存入資料庫
    - 送養狀態設為「審核中」(SUBMITTED)
    - 等待管理員審核 (透過 /api/animals/{id}/publish 發布)
    - 必填欄位: 名稱、物種、性別、年齡、縣市、描述
    - 至少1張圖片
end note

@enduml 個人送養發佈流程
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 個人送養發佈流程 (Personal Animal Adoption Posting)

actor "一般會員\n(Owner)" as Owner
participant "animals.py\n(Blueprint)" as AnimalsBlueprint
participant "Animal\n(Model)" as AnimalModel
participant "User\n(Model)" as UserModel
participant "minio_helper.py\n(Utils)" as MinioHelper
participant "AnimalImage\n(Model)" as ImageModel
database "MySQL" as DB
database "MinIO\n(Object Storage)" as MinIO

== 1. 建立動物資料 (草稿狀態) ==

Owner -> AnimalsBlueprint: POST /api/animals\n{name, species, breed, sex, dob, description}
activate AnimalsBlueprint

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
AnimalsBlueprint -> UserModel: 查詢當前用戶 (get_jwt_identity)
activate UserModel
UserModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 決定動物類型\n(檢查 user.role)
note right
  - 如果是 SHELTER_MEMBER 且有 primary_shelter_id
    -> shelter_id = primary_shelter_id, owner_id = None
  - 其他情況 (GENERAL_MEMBER)
    -> owner_id = current_user_id, shelter_id = None
end note

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalModel: 建立 Animal 物件\nstatus=DRAFT\nowner_id=current_user_id\ncreated_by=current_user_id
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: animal (草稿)
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.add(animal)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: 成功
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint --> Owner: 201 Created\n{animal: {animal_id, status: "DRAFT", ...}}

deactivate AnimalsBlueprint

== 2. 上傳動物圖片 ==

Owner -> AnimalsBlueprint: POST /api/animals/{animal_id}/images\n{image_url: "data:image/jpeg;base64,..."}
activate AnimalsBlueprint

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal (animal_id)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: animal
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 權限檢查\n(animal.owner_id == current_user_id)
note right
  權限邏輯:
  1. 個人送養動物: owner_id == current_user_id
  2. 收容所動物: user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER 
     且 user.primary_shelter_id == animal.shelter_id
  3. 管理員: user.role == ADMIN
end note

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 解析 base64 圖片數據\nheader, base64_data = image_url.split(',')

AnimalsBlueprint -> MinioHelper: get_minio_client()
activate MinioHelper
MinioHelper --> AnimalsBlueprint: minio_client
deactivate MinioHelper

AnimalsBlueprint -> MinIO: minio_client.put_object(\nbucket, storage_key, image_stream)
activate MinIO
MinIO --> AnimalsBlueprint: 上傳成功
deactivate MinIO

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 構建公開 URL\nfinal_url = "http://{MINIO_ENDPOINT}/{bucket}/{storage_key}"

AnimalsBlueprint -> ImageModel: 建立 AnimalImage\n(animal_id, storage_key, url, order)
activate ImageModel
ImageModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: image
deactivate ImageModel

AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.add(image)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: 成功
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint --> Owner: 201 Created\n{image: {animal_image_id, url, ...}}

deactivate AnimalsBlueprint

== 3. 更新動物資料 ==

Owner -> AnimalsBlueprint: PATCH /api/animals/{animal_id}\n{name, description, ...}
activate AnimalsBlueprint

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證權限
AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: animal
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 權限檢查\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 更新欄位\n(name, description, species, breed, ...)
AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: 成功
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint --> Owner: 200 OK\n{animal: {...}}

deactivate AnimalsBlueprint

== 4. 提交審核 ==

Owner -> AnimalsBlueprint: POST /api/animals/{animal_id}/submit
activate AnimalsBlueprint

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證權限
AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal
activate DB
DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: animal
deactivate DB

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 權限檢查\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 狀態檢查\n(status == DRAFT)

alt 狀態不是 DRAFT
  AnimalsBlueprint --> Owner: 400 Bad Request\n"只能提交草稿狀態的動物"
else 狀態是 DRAFT
  AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = SUBMITTED
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: 更新成功
  deactivate AnimalModel
  
  AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: 成功
  deactivate DB
  
  AnimalsBlueprint --> Owner: 200 OK\n{message: "動物已提交審核", status: "SUBMITTED"}
end

deactivate AnimalsBlueprint

== 5. 管理員審核發布 (Admin) ==

actor "管理員\n(Admin)" as Admin

Admin -> AnimalsBlueprint: POST /api/animals/{animal_id}/publish
activate AnimalsBlueprint

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證管理員權限
AnimalsBlueprint -> UserModel: 查詢當前用戶
activate UserModel
UserModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: current_user
deactivate UserModel

AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalsBlueprint: 檢查 user.role == ADMIN

alt 不是管理員
  AnimalsBlueprint --> Admin: 403 Forbidden\n"需要管理員權限"
else 是管理員
  AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: animal
  deactivate DB
  
  AnimalsBlueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = PUBLISHED
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel --> AnimalsBlueprint: 更新成功
  deactivate AnimalModel
  
  AnimalsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalsBlueprint: 成功
  deactivate DB
  
  AnimalsBlueprint --> Admin: 200 OK\n{message: "動物已發布", status: "PUBLISHED"}
end

deactivate AnimalsBlueprint

note over Owner, MinIO
  **架構特點 (Decouple Principles)**:
  1. 分層架構: Blueprint (API層) -> Model (數據層) -> Database
  2. 工具類解耦: minio_helper.py 獨立處理對象存儲邏輯
  3. JWT 認證中介層: @jwt_required() 裝飾器統一處理認證
  4. 權限檢查集中: Blueprint 層統一處理權限邏輯
  5. 狀態機管理: DRAFT -> SUBMITTED -> PUBLISHED 清晰的狀態轉換
end note

@enduml